# Offline CP2K twin note — dfpt-finite-q-si

No CP2K module on the pin host this shift. When available:

- System: diamond Si, 2-atom primitive, a = 5.43 Å
- Method: Quickstep DFPT / PHONON or VIBRATIONAL_ANALYSIS with GTH+MOLOPT
  (or NC-compatible) at a comparable cutoff; request finite-q or supercell
  path that samples the X point of the primitive cell.
- Record: ω(X) [cm⁻¹] for all 6 branches, CP2K version, wall time.
- Fair ratio: T_atv / T_cp2k with OMP matched; require ≤ 10 unless exempt.

ATV public API: `cpu::pw::DfptPhonon` with `q_frac = {0.5, 0, 0}`.
